    {
      "id": "s-83f8998c808d91ab",
      "kind": "release",
      "title": "v3.5.0",
      "url": "https://github.com/umami-software/umami/releases/tag/v3.5.0",
      "collected_at": "2026-11-21T07:21:22+00:00",
      "published_at": "2026-11-12T02:57:20Z",
      "text": "Umami `v3.5.0` adds **browser error tracking**, improved replay navigation, and fixes across tracking, reporting, and sharing.\r\n\r\n## New features\r\n\r\n### Browser error tracking\r\n\r\nCapture JavaScript errors alongside your analytics and investigate affected visits.\r\n\r\n- Automaticall",
